rial display, and kilogram-only persistence. Empty diaries retain access to weight entry. The latest daily measurement links to the existing measurements history; all new text is available in German, English, French, Italian and Japanese.\n\n### Changed\n- **Diary Empty Day and Weight Card (`DiaryScreen`, `WeightCard`):** Today no", "en-US": "### Added\n- **Diary Weight Entry (`WeightCard`, `WeightRuler`):** Add weight directly below supplements with an animated inline ruler, explicit save/cancel, metric or imperial display, and kilogram-only persistence. Empty diaries retain access to weight entry. The latest daily measurement links to the existing measurements history; all new text is available in German, English, French, Italian and Japanese.\n\n### Changed\n- **Diary Empty Day and Weight Card (`DiaryScreen`, `WeightCard`):** Today no"}}}}}}